WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:04.000
The train to Hamburg leaves from platform 4.

2
00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:04.000 line:0
Der Zug nach Hamburg fährt von Gleis 4.

3
00:00:04.500 --> 00:00:07.250
It is ten minutes late today.

4
00:00:04.500 --> 00:00:07.250 line:0
Er hat heute zehn Minuten Verspätung.

5
00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:11.000
The bakery next to the station opens at six.
They sell fresh rolls.

6
00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:09.600 line:0
Die Bäckerei am Bahnhof öffnet um sechs.

7
00:00:09.600 --> 00:00:11.000 line:0
Sie verkauft frische Brötchen.

8
00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:13.500
<i>Rain is coming.</i>

9
00:00:13.200 --> 00:00:16.600 line:0
Morgen scheint wieder die Sonne.

10
00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:19.000
Take an umbrella with you.

11
00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:21.000 line:0
Gute Reise!
